  <Properties>
    <metaDescription>
      <Value><![CDATA[There are lots of way you can use AI in digital marketing and website management – it is changing and will change how we manage our digital channels. In this article we talk about some of the foundations for that.]]></Value>
    </metaDescription>
    <metaTitle>
      <Value><![CDATA[Why digital marketing teams should work on defining AI foundations now]]></Value>
    </metaTitle>
